# Local analysis workspace — exploratory scripts, generated reports, and a
# read-only dump of production under analysis/data (real retailer names, prices
# and staff names). Never belongs in the repo. Ignored on main so every branch
# inherits it and no session can sweep it in with `git add -A`.
analysis/

# Working data pulled out of Tally or the app: shop names, item names, stock
# levels, name-matching worksheets. This repo is PUBLIC, so nothing derived from
# the real book belongs in it. The one exception is the supplier price list,
# which is already tracked and carries no customer data.
data/
!data/ZebronicsPriceList.csv

# Real customer data kept locally only — never tracked. The balances list is
# the one printed for the owner to confirm with his father; Retailers.csv is a
# one-off import artifact. Both name real shops and were purged from history.
/Retailers.csv
docs/tally-retailer-balances-*.md

# One-off worklist of shops to delete, from the July cleanup. Names three
# shops that no longer exist in the app; kept on disk, not tracked.
/toremoveretailers.csv

# scratch README draft — promoted to README.md when approved
README_DEMO.md
